WEBVTT

00:00:01.679 --> 00:00:02.653
Bonafide

00:00:04.527 --> 00:00:05.891
No luck, no loss

00:00:09.713 --> 00:00:11.331
No price, no cost

00:00:14.644 --> 00:00:16.053
Just another baby love

00:00:17.582 --> 00:00:18.346
With a mama

00:00:20.355 --> 00:00:21.629
And a father somewhere

00:00:25.451 --> 00:00:27.429
And new life, new precious delights

00:00:27.954 --> 00:00:28.763
Everywhere

00:00:30.292 --> 00:00:31.746
When the grass was green

00:00:35.388 --> 00:00:37.277
And the next life was unforeseen

00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:41.534
Now in a sandbox

00:00:43.977 --> 00:00:46.720
Perimeters of chance

00:00:47.964 --> 00:00:48.743
Tiny hands

00:00:51.831 --> 00:00:53.614
Endless reasons to dance

00:00:55.968 --> 00:00:57.721
Boundless places to prance

00:01:00.884 --> 00:01:02.368
Curly hair to play in

00:01:04.571 --> 00:01:06.610
That's a moment I want to stay in

00:01:07.314 --> 00:01:08.828
Dream of a land

00:01:09.847 --> 00:01:12.080
My soul is from

00:01:17.746 --> 00:01:21.838
I hear a hand stroke on a drum

00:01:28.208 --> 00:01:30.127
Shades of delight

00:01:30.861 --> 00:01:33.559
Cocoa hue

00:01:38.565 --> 00:01:42.013
Rich as the night

00:01:42.193 --> 00:01:46.643
Afro blue
